{"id": "train-04-001", "text": "Since morning nothing is opening on my phone, WhatsApp is not sending, YouTube is just going round and round. My grandson pressed something yesterday, please tell me what to do.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-002", "text": "There is a small aeroplane picture on top of my phone and now nothing is coming, no messages, no news. How to remove it?", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-003", "text": "Internet has completely stopped on my mobile. Even Google is saying no connection. What has happened?", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-004", "text": "I was trying to switch off the sound and touched some buttons on top, after that my phone is showing no internet. Kindly help, I have to check my pension in the bank app.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-005", "text": "How do I switch on the data again? Somebody switched it off and I don't know where it is.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-006", "text": "My Wi-Fi symbol has gone from the top and nothing is loading at home. Other people in the house are using it fine.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-007", "text": "Phone is saying \"you are offline\" in every app. I am very worried, my daughter will call on video from America today.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-008", "text": "Google Maps is not showing anything, it says check connection. I am sitting in the auto and do not know the way. Please help quickly.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-009", "text": "Some data saver thing has come on and now apps are not opening properly. Please tell me how to put it off.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-010", "text": "Nothing online is working on this phone, not news, not WhatsApp, nothing. It was perfectly fine till yesterday night.", "labels": ["no_internet"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-011", "text": "Phone is showing connected to our home Wi-Fi, full lines also there, but YouTube is not playing anything. What is the problem?", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-012", "text": "It is showing the name of our Wi-Fi with tick mark only, still no page is opening. I have tried many times.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-013", "text": "My son put the new Wi-Fi box yesterday. Phone says connected, but WhatsApp messages are not going. Very frustrating.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-014", "text": "The Wi-Fi sign is full on top, but Google is saying no internet. How can it be connected and not working both?", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-015", "text": "Connected it is showing, but nothing opens. I am sitting near the box itself.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-016", "text": "At my daughter's house the phone joined their Wi-Fi properly, it says connected, but the news app is blank, just blank.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-017", "text": "How do I make the internet work when the Wi-Fi is connected? Pages keep loading and loading and then stop.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-018", "text": "The fan symbol on top is full, my phone shows connected, but the bank app says unable to connect. I need to see my FD details today.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-019", "text": "Wi-Fi is on and connected, it says \"connected, no internet\" in small letters. What does this mean? Please fix it.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-020", "text": "Since the power cut came and went, the phone is still showing connected to Wi-Fi but nothing loads. Television in the same house is working fine.", "labels": ["wifi_no_load"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-021", "text": "My phone is not ringing when somebody calls. Later I see three, four missed calls from my son and he is getting angry with me.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-022", "text": "WhatsApp call from my granddaughter came and I did not hear anything. Only afterwards I saw it. Why no sound?", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-023", "text": "Phone is only shaking when call comes, no ringing. I keep it in my bag so I cannot feel it.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-024", "text": "There is a moon sign on top and now calls are coming silently. Please tell me how to remove it.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-025", "text": "How to make the phone ring loudly again? Somebody has put it on silent mode and I don't know how to take it off.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-026", "text": "Yesterday I attended a function and kept the phone quiet. Since then no call is ringing at all. I am missing important calls from the doctor.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-027", "text": "The bell sound has completely stopped when people call me. I only find out afterwards that someone had called.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-028", "text": "Do Not Disturb has come on by itself I think. Calls are not ringing. Kindly help.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
{"id": "train-04-029", "text": "I have missed my brother's call twice today because the phone did not make any noise. Earlier it used to ring very loud.", "labels": ["phone_not_ringing"], "tags": [], "source": "generated", "generator": "claude-fresh", "batch": "train-04", "persona": {"age": "senior", "comfort": "low", "variety": "indian", "style": "frustrated", "typos": "none"}}
